{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://jobforge.invalid/api/executor/v2/schema.json",
  "title": "JobForge supervised executor frame v2",
  "description": "Strict UTF-8 JSON Lines. Duplicate/unknown keys, null required fields, unpaired surrogates, numbers outside finite binary64 range (including nested integers), depth >64 and trailing content are rejected. Range validation does not round or coerce decoded integers. All times are safe integer CLOCK_BOOTTIME milliseconds within one Linux time namespace. Ordinary and dedicated metering pipes are distinct; metering never grants execution authority.",
  "x-max-frame-bytes": 393216,
  "x-sequence": [
    "execute_step",
    "(call_intent -> call_permit -> call_observation)*",
    "step_result"
  ],
  "x-conversation-rules": [
    "All frames bind the first request_id and exact binding. No v1 frames or usage objects in ordinary observations.",
    "execute_step deadline = emitted_mono_ms + remaining_ms; permit dispatch/call deadlines = emitted_mono_ms + dispatch_ms/call_ms. Receiver queue delay never resets a deadline. Reject future emitted stamps, backward receiver clocks, same-direction backward emitted stamps, overflow, or equality at ordinary expiry.",
    "One intent and one possible physical send at a time. CanDispatch consumes a fresh permit exactly once before its anchored dispatch deadline; only consumed permits admit metering.",
    "search_policy order is profile_version, profile_tags, query_embedding, search_policy under one tool_invocation_id.",
    "Ordinary output is at most 393216 bytes including LF. Dedicated metering_report and metering_ack frames are at most 8192 bytes including LF and cannot be sent on ordinary stdout.",
    "Metering usage hash is the jobforge.run.usage.v1 length-prefixed SHA256 of decimal input_tokens, output_tokens, cached_input_tokens and receipt_hash. Each token field <= 2^53-1 and cached <= input. Their sum may exceed the wire safe integer bound; retain the original fields for ledger anomaly handling, never reject or truncate that report. Output above 1024 is valid metering, not execution success.",
    "Reports require the original consumed permit call_sequence, physical_call_id and parameter_hash. One distinct usage per call; identical duplicates are idempotent. No action, cursor or permission fields.",
    "Reports can arrive before or after the ordinary observation, including after stop or execution expiry. Each pipe/direction orders its own emitted stamps; never compare metering emitted stamps with ordinary arrival order.",
    "reported observations wait for matching metering usage_hash and a settled ACK before next intent, correction or result. unknown has null usage_hash and retains hold. Existing received reports cannot be bypassed with unknown.",
    "Token overrun, anomaly/unconfirmed ACK, missing/mismatched report or settlement prevent further execution. Overrun reports remain available for ledger settlement; no ACK can reopen a stopped or expired conversation.",
    "Caller must drain/join the metering reader and wait/verify process exit before Commit; successful step_result alone is not commit authority.",
    "Free subcalls have call_ms <=10000, zero token limits and no metering. Chat/query embedding <=60000; ordinary output bound remains 1024. Tool result <=8192, other result/input <=16384, checkpoint <=262144 bytes.",
    "Denied permits and rejected/unknown observations forbid further sends; only error step_result can terminate. No arbitrary next cursor.",
    "Permit emission must follow its intent emission; observation/report emission must follow consumed dispatch. A post-settlement intent/result emission must not precede its settled ACK emission.",
    "An unconfirmed ACK may later be confirmed settled/anomaly with the same usage hash, without reopening execution. A valid report whose ordinary observation hash mismatches is still accepted for settlement while ordinary execution is stopped.",
    "unknown accepted responses may finish with the full hold retained. A subsequently received valid report is accounted but stops ordinary execution; it cannot retroactively bypass the reported/settled barrier."
  ],
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/execute_step"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/call_intent"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/call_permit"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/call_observation"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/step_result"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/metering_report"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/metering_ack"
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "key": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$"
    },
    "uuid": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
    },
    "sha256": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "binding": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "tenant_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/key"
        },
        "worker_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/key"
        },
        "profile_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/key"
        },
        "run_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "step_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "profile_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "snapshot_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "input_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "attempt_no": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "fencing_token": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "cursor_version": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "step_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 32
        },
        "step_kind": {
          "enum": [
            "read_ticket",
            "get_order",
            "get_delivery",
            "search_policy",
            "model_proposal",
            "protocol_correction",
            "submit_proposal"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "tenant_id",
        "worker_id",
        "profile_id",
        "run_id",
        "step_id",
        "session_id",
        "snapshot_id",
        "profile_hash",
        "snapshot_hash",
        "input_hash",
        "attempt_no",
        "fencing_token",
        "cursor_version",
        "step_sequence",
        "step_kind"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "usage": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "input_tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "output_tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "cached_input_tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "receipt_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "usage_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "input_tokens",
        "output_tokens",
        "cached_input_tokens",
        "receipt_hash",
        "usage_hash"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "execute_step": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "execute_step"
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "remaining_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 180000
        },
        "trace_context": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 512,
          "pattern": "^[ -~]*$"
        },
        "checkpoint": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Protected registered-step data, with duplicate keys rejected recursively. The byte limit measures the UTF-8 JSON value exactly as present in the frame.",
          "x-max-utf8-json-bytes": 262144
        },
        "input": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Protected registered-step data, with duplicate keys rejected recursively. The byte limit measures the UTF-8 JSON value exactly as present in the frame.",
          "x-max-utf8-json-bytes": 16384
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "kind",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "remaining_ms",
        "trace_context",
        "checkpoint",
        "input",
        "emitted_mono_ms"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "call_intent": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "call_intent"
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "call_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 44
        },
        "subcall": {
          "enum": [
            "get_order",
            "get_delivery",
            "profile_version",
            "profile_tags",
            "query_embedding",
            "search_policy",
            "chat"
          ]
        },
        "parameter_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "tool_invocation_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
            },
            {
              "const": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "kind",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "call_sequence",
        "subcall",
        "parameter_hash",
        "tool_invocation_id",
        "emitted_mono_ms"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "subcall": {
                "const": "chat"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "tool_invocation_id": {
                "const": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "tool_invocation_id": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "call_permit": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "call_permit"
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "call_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 44
        },
        "subcall": {
          "enum": [
            "get_order",
            "get_delivery",
            "profile_version",
            "profile_tags",
            "query_embedding",
            "search_policy",
            "chat"
          ]
        },
        "parameter_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "tool_invocation_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
            },
            {
              "const": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "physical_call_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
            },
            {
              "const": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "granted": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "error_code": {
          "enum": [
            "",
            "BUDGET_EXHAUSTED",
            "STOP_REQUESTED",
            "STALE_LEASE",
            "PROFILE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE",
            "PROTOCOL_ERROR",
            "CALL_CONFLICT",
            "OUTPUT_INVALID",
            "INPUT_INVALID",
            "TIMEOUT"
          ]
        },
        "dispatch_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 30000
        },
        "call_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 60000
        },
        "input_token_limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "output_token_limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1024
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "kind",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "call_sequence",
        "subcall",
        "parameter_hash",
        "tool_invocation_id",
        "physical_call_id",
        "granted",
        "error_code",
        "dispatch_ms",
        "call_ms",
        "input_token_limit",
        "output_token_limit",
        "emitted_mono_ms"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "granted": {
                "const": false
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "physical_call_id": {
                "const": ""
              },
              "error_code": {
                "not": {
                  "const": ""
                }
              },
              "dispatch_ms": {
                "const": 0
              },
              "call_ms": {
                "const": 0
              },
              "input_token_limit": {
                "const": 0
              },
              "output_token_limit": {
                "const": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "physical_call_id": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
              },
              "error_code": {
                "const": ""
              },
              "dispatch_ms": {
                "minimum": 1
              },
              "call_ms": {
                "minimum": 1
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "subcall": {
                "enum": [
                  "get_order",
                  "get_delivery",
                  "profile_version",
                  "profile_tags",
                  "search_policy"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "call_ms": {
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "input_token_limit": {
                "const": 0
              },
              "output_token_limit": {
                "const": 0
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "subcall": {
                "const": "chat"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "tool_invocation_id": {
                "const": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "tool_invocation_id": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "call_observation": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "call_observation"
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "call_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 44
        },
        "physical_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "transport_outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "response",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "http_status": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 599
        },
        "business_outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "accepted",
            "rejected",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "error_code": {
          "enum": [
            "",
            "BUDGET_EXHAUSTED",
            "STOP_REQUESTED",
            "STALE_LEASE",
            "PROFILE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE",
            "PROTOCOL_ERROR",
            "CALL_CONFLICT",
            "OUTPUT_INVALID",
            "INPUT_INVALID",
            "TIMEOUT"
          ]
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "usage_disposition": {
          "enum": [
            "unknown",
            "reported"
          ]
        },
        "usage_hash": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "kind",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "call_sequence",
        "physical_call_id",
        "transport_outcome",
        "http_status",
        "business_outcome",
        "error_code",
        "emitted_mono_ms",
        "usage_disposition",
        "usage_hash"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "usage_disposition": {
                "const": "reported"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "usage_hash": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "usage_hash": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "transport_outcome": {
                "const": "unknown"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "http_status": {
                "const": 0
              },
              "business_outcome": {
                "const": "unknown"
              },
              "usage_disposition": {
                "const": "unknown"
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "http_status": {
                "minimum": 100
              },
              "business_outcome": {
                "enum": [
                  "accepted",
                  "rejected"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "business_outcome": {
                "const": "accepted"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "error_code": {
                "const": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "error_code": {
                "not": {
                  "const": ""
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "step_result": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "step_result"
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "success",
            "error"
          ]
        },
        "error_code": {
          "enum": [
            "",
            "BUDGET_EXHAUSTED",
            "STOP_REQUESTED",
            "STALE_LEASE",
            "PROFILE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE",
            "PROTOCOL_ERROR",
            "CALL_CONFLICT",
            "OUTPUT_INVALID",
            "INPUT_INVALID",
            "TIMEOUT"
          ]
        },
        "result": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Protected registered-step data, with duplicate keys rejected recursively. The byte limit measures the UTF-8 JSON value exactly as present in the frame.",
          "x-max-utf8-json-bytes": 16384
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "kind",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "outcome",
        "error_code",
        "result",
        "emitted_mono_ms"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "outcome": {
                "const": "success"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "error_code": {
                "const": ""
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "error_code": {
                "not": {
                  "const": ""
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "metering_report": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "metering_report"
        },
        "call_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 44
        },
        "physical_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "parameter_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/usage"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "emitted_mono_ms",
        "kind",
        "call_sequence",
        "physical_call_id",
        "parameter_hash",
        "usage"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "metering_ack": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "const": 2
        },
        "request_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/binding"
        },
        "emitted_mono_ms": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "metering_ack"
        },
        "call_sequence": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 44
        },
        "physical_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/uuid"
        },
        "usage_hash": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sha256"
        },
        "settlement": {
          "enum": [
            "settled",
            "anomaly",
            "unconfirmed"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "request_id",
        "binding",
        "emitted_mono_ms",
        "kind",
        "call_sequence",
        "physical_call_id",
        "usage_hash",
        "settlement"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "x-max-metering-frame-bytes": 8192
}
